gh-quality 3A games.\n\nI haven't found any related error logs to help pinpoint the source of the problem, so I can only describe the situation because I don't know what is causing it. This issue only occurs with 4.4.\n\nMy GPU drivers are up to date, but the issue mentioned in #102219 still occurs. While this issue is present in 4.3, it does not cause a BSOD in 4.3.\n\nSo I wanted to report this and ask for help. Here are my system and hardware details:\n\n**System**: Windows 10 Pro 22H2 19045.5487\n\n**CPU**: 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i9-12900KF 3.20 GHz\n\n**RAM**: 32.0 GB\n\n**GPU**: NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4090\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nThe BSOD doesn't appear immediately after launching 4.4 or when debugging, but after a random amount of time, the BSOD suddenly occurs. I have checked memory usage and CPU usage, and there are no abnormalities, which is quite confusing.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[g1.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18920533/g1.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"jjj201200","id":3397549,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzOTc1NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3397549?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjj201200","html_url":"https://github.com/jjj201200","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjj201200/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjj201200/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjj201200/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjj201200/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjj201200/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjj201200/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjj201200/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjj201200/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjj201200/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/r